cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use zames in your work or research, please cite it as below."
title: "zames_pro — terminal coding agent for DeepSeek, Qwen and GLM (no API key)"
abstract: >-
  A terminal coding agent that drives a real web chat LLM (DeepSeek, Qwen,
  GLM) through a Playwright browser (DeepSeek and Qwen headless, GLM in a
  visible window). It reads and edits files, runs shell commands and commits
  to git like Claude Code / Codex CLI, but needs no API key and bills nothing
  per token.
